725	     * {@value #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already carry the new owner's adjusted
726	     * business-day {@code registrationDate}, otherwise {@code false}. Counted the same way as the
727	     * daily-limit rule and computed before the new owner is persisted, so it counts only the
728	     * pre-existing owners for that day.
729	     */
